---
// Illustration in the home hero, behind the strategiesessie card (Kjell,
// 2026-10-07, after lemonade.com's hero). An ink drawing in the artikel
// illustration style (design-spec.md, "Artikel illustrations"): a road across
// the flat Westhoek towards the Ieper skyline, fog lifting on the way. The
// drawing itself leaves the top-left empty; its skyline forms the diagonal from
// the middle to the top right. The empty background is transparent, so the red
// hero shows through. Source PNG: brands/very-klear/assets/illustrations/.
---

<img
  class="hero-illus"
  src="/hero/ieper.webp"
  alt=""
  width="1400"
  height="1274"
  decoding="async"
  fetchpriority="high"
/>

<style>
  .hero-illus {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 96%;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 62%;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: right bottom;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-illus { height: auto; width: 100%; max-width: none; }
  }
</style>
